WEBVTT

00:01:37.444 --> 00:01:39.810
"Kiyone"
"Mihoshi"

00:02:03.437 --> 00:02:05.505
Aah! Oh, my God!

00:02:05.505 --> 00:02:09.100
Mihoshi, wake up!
We're gonna be late for work!

00:02:10.877 --> 00:02:13.280
You are under arrest.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:16.215
Mihoshi! You've got to wake up!

00:02:18.084 --> 00:02:20.518
Get your butt out of bed!

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:35.669
So anyway, and then...

00:02:35.669 --> 00:02:39.973
and then I was just about
to arrest this vicious criminal.

00:02:39.973 --> 00:02:42.642
Enough about your dream.
Finish your breakfast.

00:02:42.642 --> 00:02:44.511
What are you going to
do if you get fired again?

00:02:44.511 --> 00:02:48.815
All right, but are we allowed to
have part-time jobs on the side?

00:02:48.815 --> 00:02:50.250
We have to.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.685
Everything is so expensive here on Earth.

00:02:51.685 --> 00:02:54.779
How else could we pay
the rent on this apartment?

00:02:57.591 --> 00:02:59.493
Yummy!

00:02:59.493 --> 00:03:03.156
Wow, Kiyone, your <i>miso</i> soup is just the best.

00:03:04.498 --> 00:03:06.625
Thanks so much.

00:03:12.539 --> 00:03:14.632
Bye! I'm leaving!

00:03:27.254 --> 00:03:31.124
Ryoko, could you spare the
time to help us clear the table?

00:03:31.124 --> 00:03:34.457
Hmm? Were you saying something?

00:03:36.563 --> 00:03:38.765
If she doesn't want to do
anything around the house,

00:03:38.765 --> 00:03:39.766
she should leave and go live on her own.

00:03:39.766 --> 00:03:43.169
She should follow Mihoshi's example.

00:03:43.169 --> 00:03:47.574
I wonder what Mihoshi and Kiyone are up to.

00:03:47.574 --> 00:03:49.442
I wonder too.

00:03:49.442 --> 00:03:52.112
Poor Kiyone is so unlucky.

00:03:52.112 --> 00:03:57.250
There she was on her way to
the top and Mihoshi for a partner.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.619
Back, back.

00:03:59.619 --> 00:04:02.053
Keep coming.

00:04:03.089 --> 00:04:05.358
Stop.

00:04:05.358 --> 00:04:08.595
Hey, you're a natural. Looking good.

00:04:08.595 --> 00:04:12.098
- Really?
- Oh, yeah. Keep up the good work.

00:04:12.098 --> 00:04:15.068
Yes, Sir. I will!

00:04:15.068 --> 00:04:16.636
I graduated second in my class

00:04:16.636 --> 00:04:20.595
from the Galaxy Police
Academy, and now look at me.

00:04:22.475 --> 00:04:25.812
I think you should stop now.

00:04:25.812 --> 00:04:28.042
Was that my fault?

00:04:33.153 --> 00:04:35.221
Kiyone!

00:04:35.221 --> 00:04:39.326
What did I do wrong?

00:04:39.326 --> 00:04:42.162
Did I do something wrong?

00:04:42.162 --> 00:04:44.926
Take the responsibility.

00:05:13.994 --> 00:05:15.528
What's the matter with you?

00:05:15.528 --> 00:05:16.830
Have you got a
stomachache or something?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.559
No, I don't!

00:05:18.898 --> 00:05:22.857
"Convenience Store"

00:05:23.103 --> 00:05:27.574
I'm sorry I caused so much trouble.

00:05:27.574 --> 00:05:28.475
Don't worry about it.

00:05:28.475 --> 00:05:32.512
Let's hurry up and finish shopping
or we'll be late for our next job.

00:05:32.512 --> 00:05:34.214
Okay!

00:05:34.214 --> 00:05:37.651
Could you get me a hot pad from over there?

00:05:37.651 --> 00:05:40.053
Get that big one.

00:05:40.053 --> 00:05:42.989
You sure are sensitive to cold.

00:05:42.989 --> 00:05:44.957
Construction's a cold business.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.290
Can I buy some snacks?

00:05:55.435 --> 00:05:57.426
Oh, okay.

00:06:08.448 --> 00:06:11.084
Hey! Just what do you
think you're doing, Mihoshi?

00:06:11.084 --> 00:06:12.984
It's not okay?

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:21.623
"Cam Nadold's"

00:06:21.961 --> 00:06:25.131
So, bacon and egg
sandwich and a small Coke.

00:06:25.131 --> 00:06:27.100
And would you like some fries with that, Sir?

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:28.401
Yeah, sure, okay.

00:06:28.401 --> 00:06:31.438
That's an affirmative
on the fries. Very good, Sir.

00:06:31.438 --> 00:06:35.308
Hello, I'm here to serve you.
What can I get for you?

00:06:35.308 --> 00:06:37.143
Just a hamburger and coffee.

00:06:37.143 --> 00:06:40.313
Okay, a hamburger and one coffee.

00:06:40.313 --> 00:06:43.383
Would you care for fries,
apple pie, French toast,

00:06:43.383 --> 00:06:45.719
a sandwich, or a vanilla shake with that?

00:06:45.719 --> 00:06:49.456
Hot chocolate would be good too.
How about a pork chop burger?

00:06:49.456 --> 00:06:51.224
Our pork chop burgers are the best and...

00:06:51.224 --> 00:06:52.659
Stop already!

00:06:52.659 --> 00:06:55.829
But you told me to give
them some suggestions, Kiyone.

00:06:55.829 --> 00:06:58.231
And what's the customer
supposed to do with all that?

00:06:58.231 --> 00:07:00.567
They all taste really good, though.

00:07:00.567 --> 00:07:02.435
That is not the point!

00:07:02.435 --> 00:07:04.237
What do you think of that, Mr. Customer?

00:07:04.237 --> 00:07:08.274
You like pork chop burgers, don't you?

00:07:08.274 --> 00:07:10.243
Excuse me.

00:07:10.243 --> 00:07:11.911
How may I help you?

00:07:11.911 --> 00:07:15.014
A teriyaki sandwich and a Coke, please.

00:07:15.014 --> 00:07:18.284
A teriyaki sandwich and a Coke, Sir.
We're having a teriyaki special today.

00:07:18.284 --> 00:07:22.322
If you order this combo with
fries, it would be a better deal.

00:07:22.322 --> 00:07:23.923
Make it a combo, then.

00:07:23.923 --> 00:07:25.925
Right. Thank you very much, Sir.

00:07:25.925 --> 00:07:30.630
Oh, yes, we are having a teriyaki special.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:35.401
And if you take a combo, it'll all
be free with fries and everything.

00:07:35.401 --> 00:07:36.959
You're a liar.

00:07:37.637 --> 00:07:40.003
Hey, what's going on here?

00:07:43.643 --> 00:07:46.946
Thank you for waiting. A combo
with a large burger and a Coke...

00:07:46.946 --> 00:07:49.005
...and one iced tea.

00:07:52.185 --> 00:07:55.985
Oh, I beg you, please don't
let that be what I think it is.

00:07:58.024 --> 00:08:01.027
Ouch! That hurt!

00:08:01.027 --> 00:08:02.562
Oh, boy.

00:08:02.562 --> 00:08:04.330
Not you again!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:07.667
What's wrong with you guys, anyway?

00:08:07.667 --> 00:08:09.794
I'm so sorry.

00:08:11.604 --> 00:08:15.108
Mr. Manager, we've got an emergency.
Can we please leave early?

00:08:15.108 --> 00:08:17.110
Early? Not again!

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:18.945
Come on, Mihoshi. Let's go!

00:08:18.945 --> 00:08:20.435
Okay.

00:08:23.249 --> 00:08:25.843
Hey, come back here!

00:08:36.629 --> 00:08:38.431
That emergency call came
from somewhere near Jupiter.

00:08:38.431 --> 00:08:41.434
Let's go. No time to lose.

00:08:41.434 --> 00:08:43.369
Right.

00:08:43.369 --> 00:08:44.871
Could this be an armed robbery

00:08:44.871 --> 00:08:47.707
or a Space Mafia case?

00:08:47.707 --> 00:08:49.442
This is exciting.

00:08:49.442 --> 00:08:52.639
Before you get too excited,
change your uniform.

00:09:08.428 --> 00:09:12.498
Can you hold that thing?
I'll try to open up this valve here.

00:09:12.498 --> 00:09:14.601
Uh, this thing here?

00:09:14.601 --> 00:09:16.369
Like this?

00:09:16.369 --> 00:09:18.200
Yeah, that's right.

00:09:26.479 --> 00:09:29.175
Yea, you fixed it!

00:09:29.949 --> 00:09:32.118
Thank you so much. I was very worried.

00:09:32.118 --> 00:09:34.320
My ship broke down
in the middle of nowhere,

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.356
and I didn't know what I was going to do.

00:09:36.356 --> 00:09:38.091
Don't mention it.

00:09:38.091 --> 00:09:42.495
Being a resident officer must
be quite a difficult job, huh?

00:09:42.495 --> 00:09:44.397
Just doing our duty, Ma'am.

00:09:44.397 --> 00:09:46.366
How about staying here
and marrying my grandson?

00:09:46.366 --> 00:09:49.168
What do you think, young lady?

00:09:49.168 --> 00:09:51.070
I'm so flattered.

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.698
So, what do you think, Kiyone?

00:10:17.697 --> 00:10:20.667
I am beat.

00:10:20.667 --> 00:10:23.761
Yes, we're very exhausted.

00:10:29.609 --> 00:10:33.602
Hmm? I hope it's not another salesman.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.445
Yes.

00:10:37.383 --> 00:10:39.886
- Wow.
- Hello!

00:10:39.886 --> 00:10:41.621
Hi, everyone!

00:10:41.621 --> 00:10:45.224
Hi. We just came by to
see how you guys are doing.

00:10:45.224 --> 00:10:48.928
Yeah, we miss you guys. So how are you?

00:10:48.928 --> 00:10:51.798
We brought along a little
something for you to eat.

00:10:51.798 --> 00:10:55.063
- Wow, you shouldn't have!
- All you brought is sweet crap.

00:10:55.168 --> 00:10:56.235
- You have no right to talk!

00:10:56.235 --> 00:10:58.071
- Straighten up the room, will ya?
- You have no right to talk!

00:10:58.071 --> 00:10:59.973
- All right.
- You have no right to talk!

00:10:59.973 --> 00:11:01.741
Please come inside, won't you?

00:11:01.741 --> 00:11:04.043
Let's see your place. Let's go inside.

00:11:04.043 --> 00:11:06.112
I'm so glad you came over.

00:11:06.112 --> 00:11:09.315
It's so nice to see you.

00:11:09.315 --> 00:11:12.118
So this is Miho-Kiyo's place, is it?

00:11:12.118 --> 00:11:13.619
Miho-Kiyo?

00:11:13.619 --> 00:11:16.255
That's short for Mihoshi and Kiyone.

00:11:16.255 --> 00:11:17.857
Well, I don't like the sound of it!

00:11:17.857 --> 00:11:22.428
Yeah. It sounds like the name of some
goofy comedy team or something like that.

00:11:22.428 --> 00:11:25.098
Hey, goofball, shut up already.

00:11:25.098 --> 00:11:27.430
You sure are like clowns.

00:11:36.309 --> 00:11:39.245
It's really great to see
you both doing so well.

00:11:39.245 --> 00:11:41.981
Uh-huh, and we're so
happy and full of energy.

00:11:41.981 --> 00:11:43.583
Speak for yourself.
Of course you're energetic.

00:11:43.583 --> 00:11:46.352
You sleep all the time.

00:11:46.352 --> 00:11:47.754
I'm not sleeping now.

00:11:47.754 --> 00:11:50.245
No, you certainly aren't.

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:53.893
So, how have your jobs been coming along?

00:11:53.893 --> 00:11:57.063
Well, because of the
recession, things aren't easy.

00:11:57.063 --> 00:12:01.056
We're actually thinking of
getting another part-time job.

00:12:03.069 --> 00:12:05.970
It sure sounds tough.

00:12:09.809 --> 00:12:12.845
Listen, Ryoko, just
because this is the last one,

00:12:12.845 --> 00:12:15.515
doesn't mean you
have to get so competitive.

00:12:15.515 --> 00:12:17.917
The same could be said of you.

00:12:17.917 --> 00:12:22.922
Aren't we behaving a wee bit
gluttonous for the princess of Planet Jurai?

00:12:22.922 --> 00:12:26.826
I wouldn't think of it.
Please, be my guest, Ryoko.

00:12:26.826 --> 00:12:28.227
Help yourself to the last piece.

00:12:28.227 --> 00:12:31.464
Hey, Tenchi, although she's
acting as though she's generous,

00:12:31.464 --> 00:12:36.235
did you know Ayeka has
already had ten crackers?

00:12:36.235 --> 00:12:39.170
Don't think I didn't notice. I counted.

00:12:39.605 --> 00:12:43.176
I guess it doesn't bother you to
be thought of as a cookie-counter.

00:12:43.176 --> 00:12:46.112
Not only those crackers, but she's
also been munching on potato chips

00:12:46.112 --> 00:12:49.849
and chocolate puffs and stuff all by herself.

00:12:49.849 --> 00:12:51.684
What a pig, huh?

00:12:51.684 --> 00:12:53.519
Lies! Lies! It's not true!

00:12:53.519 --> 00:12:56.689
It is too. You saw her
stuffing herself, didn't you?

00:12:56.689 --> 00:12:59.192
- Huh? Right?
- Hey, let go.

00:12:59.192 --> 00:13:02.428
What are you doing with Tenchi?
Leave Tenchi alone!

00:13:02.428 --> 00:13:06.399
- You, go sit over there!
- Come on, Ryoko.

00:13:06.399 --> 00:13:10.733
It's only natural for lovers
to cuddle, isn't it, Tenchi?

00:13:16.542 --> 00:13:20.613
Oh, no! Stop it! You shouldn't
be doing that in here!

00:13:20.613 --> 00:13:22.515
Hey, stop that! Cut it out!

00:13:22.515 --> 00:13:25.051
All right. This has to be settled.

00:13:25.051 --> 00:13:29.488
You don't care about anybody but
yourself, and I've had enough of it.

00:13:30.323 --> 00:13:32.592
I won't stand it anymore!

00:13:32.592 --> 00:13:34.627
You're causing us trouble now.

00:13:34.627 --> 00:13:39.432
Please, we beg you, both
of you, take your fight outside.

00:13:39.432 --> 00:13:41.195
Here you go!

00:13:56.682 --> 00:13:58.673
Stop it!

00:14:11.797 --> 00:14:14.425
Our room... Our room...

00:14:20.373 --> 00:14:23.206
Ahh, this is good tea.

00:14:37.723 --> 00:14:41.394
Ahh, that was something else.

00:14:41.394 --> 00:14:43.385
Yes, it was.

00:14:49.168 --> 00:14:53.973
Soaking in a hot tub is the best.
It's the perfect way to relax.

00:14:53.973 --> 00:14:56.075
Yeah, you can say that again.

00:14:56.075 --> 00:14:58.411
But I thought you were
always relaxed, Mihoshi.

00:14:58.411 --> 00:15:01.080
Yeah? You think so?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.570
Definitely.

00:15:19.532 --> 00:15:22.296
- Hey, Kiyone?
- Yes, what?

00:15:23.703 --> 00:15:27.406
Say, you know what I think
we should do on our way home?

00:15:27.406 --> 00:15:30.543
What, again? We just
did that two days ago.

00:15:30.543 --> 00:15:32.245
Come on.

00:15:32.245 --> 00:15:35.248
We can't. Our budget is really tight.

00:15:35.248 --> 00:15:37.443
Please, let's go.

00:15:38.351 --> 00:15:40.251
Absolutely not!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.156
? Let's go to the place
in my dream, paradise?

00:15:44.156 --> 00:15:46.359
? Paradise?

00:15:46.359 --> 00:15:56.035
? The place in my dreams?

00:15:56.035 --> 00:15:58.004
Wonderful, Kiyone!

00:15:58.004 --> 00:16:00.206
Oh, well, thank you.

00:16:00.206 --> 00:16:02.642
Please sing this one with me, Kiyone.

00:16:02.642 --> 00:16:06.045
- Oh, no.
- Come on. Let's sing it together.

00:16:06.045 --> 00:16:08.775
Okay, I guess.

00:16:09.515 --> 00:16:17.581
"Love's Prey"

00:16:17.857 --> 00:16:21.761
<i>You were deceiving me</i>

00:16:21.761 --> 00:16:25.865
<i>I was too naïve</i>

00:16:25.865 --> 00:16:30.002
<i>When I first met</i>

00:16:30.002 --> 00:16:34.173
<i>The young businessman</i>

00:16:34.173 --> 00:16:42.481
<i>I thought he was nice looking</i>

00:16:42.481 --> 00:16:51.856
<i>But his hairpiece slipped In
the middle of our lovemaking</i>

00:16:53.492 --> 00:16:57.630
<i>You should have known better</i>

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:01.667
<i>No matter how good a rug may be</i>

00:17:01.667 --> 00:17:05.705
<i>Looking closely will reveal it</i>

00:17:05.705 --> 00:17:09.342
<i>If someone is wearing a toupee</i>

00:17:09.342 --> 00:17:13.245
<i>But it's okay now</i>

00:17:13.245 --> 00:17:17.416
<i>I don't mind anymore</i>

00:17:17.416 --> 00:17:21.487
<i>I let you deceive me</i>

00:17:21.487 --> 00:17:28.791
<i>'Cause I've fallen in love with you</i>

00:17:29.628 --> 00:17:31.897
Yea!

00:17:31.897 --> 00:17:34.133
You're really getting into this, Kiyone!

00:17:34.133 --> 00:17:37.103
Aren't you glad we came?

00:17:37.103 --> 00:17:40.639
Yeah. This is a great way
to get rid of stress, I think.

00:17:40.639 --> 00:17:43.542
Ahh. Now, which song shall we sing next?

00:17:43.542 --> 00:17:45.578
No more. Our time's almost up.

00:17:45.578 --> 00:17:48.881
Oh! Let's sing some more.

00:17:48.881 --> 00:17:51.717
I told you, our budget's
really tight this month.

00:17:51.717 --> 00:17:54.286
Please, just a little more?

00:17:54.286 --> 00:17:56.618
Absolutely not!

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:00.286
Kiyone's the one who's hooked on karaoke.

00:18:03.729 --> 00:18:05.831
Look at your score!

00:18:05.831 --> 00:18:07.633
Let's sing this one together. Whoa!

00:18:07.633 --> 00:18:12.127
- Nope.
- Come on. It'll be fun.

00:18:37.696 --> 00:18:39.365
Oh, my God! We're getting a call, Mihoshi.

00:18:39.365 --> 00:18:40.833
Roger!

00:18:40.833 --> 00:18:44.637
Hey, you two. Where
are you going? Come back!

00:18:44.637 --> 00:18:47.265
Aah! They ran away without paying!

00:18:53.879 --> 00:18:57.838
I shouldn't be preoccupied
with karaoke and forget my duty.

00:18:58.784 --> 00:19:01.187
We have to go to Saturn! Full speed!

00:19:01.187 --> 00:19:04.256
Okay. I hope we make it before it's too late.

00:19:04.256 --> 00:19:06.559
I have a feeling it'll be a big case this time.

00:19:06.559 --> 00:19:08.828
Mihoshi, you brought the microphone?

00:19:08.828 --> 00:19:10.129
What?

00:19:10.129 --> 00:19:12.996
Oh, no! I guess I did.

00:19:20.673 --> 00:19:22.208
Listen to me, officers.

00:19:22.208 --> 00:19:24.710
I was doing the speed limit. Really I was.

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:27.246
But then this guy came right at me.

00:19:27.246 --> 00:19:28.681
You're outta your mind!

00:19:28.681 --> 00:19:31.050
You're the one who wasn't
looking where he was going!

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:34.386
Will you please calm down, both of you?

00:19:34.386 --> 00:19:35.254
Now, all right.

00:19:35.254 --> 00:19:38.457
Who made the first turn at the ring of Saturn?

00:19:38.457 --> 00:19:39.358
This guy!

00:19:39.358 --> 00:19:40.326
It was you!

00:19:40.326 --> 00:19:42.361
What? You are so full of crap, liar!

00:19:42.361 --> 00:19:44.864
Are you trying to pick a fight? Huh? Are you?

00:19:44.864 --> 00:19:48.567
Stop it. Please don't fight. Stop!

00:19:48.567 --> 00:19:53.839
I've asked you nicely, and now
I'm trying to ask you nicely again.

00:19:53.839 --> 00:19:55.773
Okay. Now I'm getting upset.

00:20:05.951 --> 00:20:09.944
I suppose we'll just have to get another job.

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:29.801
Well, Mihoshi?

00:20:32.978 --> 00:20:35.037
Mihoshi?

00:20:40.586 --> 00:20:43.589
At least someone's carefree around here.

00:20:43.589 --> 00:20:49.425
Let's sing one more song together, Kiyone.

00:23:02.094 --> 00:23:05.030
It is time for the Masaki
Shrine to celebrate harvest.

00:23:05.030 --> 00:23:06.865
Come on, Sasami. Let's go have fun!

00:23:06.865 --> 00:23:08.367
Hooray! We're going to the fair!

00:23:08.367 --> 00:23:10.269
Everyone's setting up booths at the fair.

00:23:10.269 --> 00:23:13.072
Ryoko has a booth for goldfish
scooping and Ayeka for target shooting

00:23:13.072 --> 00:23:15.074
at a fun house run by Washu.

00:23:15.074 --> 00:23:17.276
One thing's for sure.
It won't be an uneventful day.

00:23:17.276 --> 00:23:19.211
Next episode is: "No Need for Carnivals!"

00:23:19.211 --> 00:23:21.080
A fair never ends.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:23.640
It's unquestionably eventful!
